  <string name="premium">Possessory Premium</string>
  <string name="premium_body">More room for the things you love: unlimited belongings, multiple homes and expanded tools.</string>
  <string name="premium_unavailable">Purchases are not enabled in this engineering preview. Store setup and receipt verification are required. The current limit is one household and 30 items; your existing records remain accessible.</string>
  <string name="restore_purchases">Restore purchases</string>
  <string name="privacy">Your privacy</string>
  <string name="privacy_body">Inventory, household records, room photos, receipts, maintenance documents and preferences are stored in private app storage. No account, advertising or analytics is required. Nothing is silently synchronized. Receipt OCR runs locally in the language you choose.\n\nSpeech input is optional and may use the device speech provider’s network service. Possessory does not retain raw recordings. Photos, receipts, notes and serial numbers are not sent to the purchase-verification service.\n\nWhen purchases are configured, Amazon user and purchase-receipt identifiers are sent to the HTTPS receipt verifier. Amazon separately handles payment. Verified offline access can remain valid for up to 90 days before an online refresh is required.\n\nExports and backups are saved only to a destination you choose; this may be a cloud document provider. Plain exports and ZIP backups are unencrypted. Password-protected backups use AES-GCM; passwords cannot be recovered. Device-unlock protection is optional and does not separately encrypt the database or attachments.\n\nDelete individual records or all local data in Settings. Uninstalling removes private records; exported copies remain where you saved them. Keep a verified backup before uninstalling. Contact support about privacy or support-correspondence deletion.</string>
  <string name="delete_all">Delete all local data</string>
  <string name="delete_all_body">Permanently remove every household, item, attachment and setting on this device? Backups you exported are not deleted.</string>
